{{!-- subject: Your certificate for {{courseTitle}} was approved --}}
{{#> layout title="Certificate approved"}}
{{#if ar}}
<p>مرحباً {{name}}،</p>
<p>تمت الموافقة على شهادتك لدورة <strong>{{courseTitle}}</strong> واكتملت الدورة.</p>
<a class="cta" href="{{url}}">إنجازاتي</a>
{{else}}
<p>Hi {{name}},</p>
<p>Your certificate for <strong>{{courseTitle}}</strong> was approved and the course is now complete.</p>
<a class="cta" href="{{url}}">View achievements</a>
{{/if}}
{{/layout}}
